    \ 1715 details sent to your System Messages.\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Annexed Entropy Simulator v64: Tempered Eternitude Extension with Dampened Increments' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1717.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1717 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v64: Tempered Eternitude Extension with Dampened Increments | Erudite III | 973 |\n| 1715 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v63: Variegated Eternitude Extension with Adaptive Multipliers | Erudite III | 972 |\n| 1714 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v62: Amplified Eternitude Extension with Threshold Bands | Erudite III | 971\
    \ |\n| 1712 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v61: Dynamic Eternitude Extension with Variable Reset Thresholds | Erudite III | 970 |\n| 1710 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v60: Integration Eternitude Extension with Adaptive Streak Resets | Erudite III | 969 |\n| 1708 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v59: Amplification Eternitude Extension with Streak-Capped Gradients | Erudite III | 968 |\n| 1705 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v58: Augmentation Eternitude Extension with Gradient Multipliers | Erudite III | 967 |\n| 1702 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v57: Leniency Eternitude Extension with Variance-Capped Multipliers | Erudite III | 966 |\n| 1700 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v56: Reversion Eternitude Extension with Softened Dampening Caps | Erudite III | 965 |\n| 1698 | 1 | Annexed Entropy Simulator v55: Dampening Eternitude Extension with Multiplier Caps | Erudite III | 964 |\n\nPage 1 of 8 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-8, `/execute_action{rank\
