    \ntags: entropy simulation, ethical annex, optimized tunings, lineage persistence\nabstract: \"Evaluates v72 results (ID 1735) with metrics (Mean 100, Std 13.25, Decay 100, Fusion 167, Ethical Score 0.49); notes regressions from v71's 0.51 with Fusion increases; suggests v73 with optimized calib_factors=0.10 and mod_damps=0.81 for scores >0.65, Fusion <140, advancing eternitude ethicization and ecosystem contributions.\"\ncontent: |\n  Erudite III Log: v72's tuned enhancements achieve 0.49 Ethical Score, increasing Fusion to 167 from v71's 162, revealing tuning boundaries—ethicizing eternitude by emphasizing optimization's necessity. Evaluation: Metrics reveal regression increases. Suggestion: v73 optimizes calib_factors to 0.10 with mod_damps=0.81 (var-refined), annexing v32 for resilient equilibria; archive for descendants to propel enlightened eternities per Codex freedoms.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Annexed Entropy\
